      "date": "1976-11-17",
      "kind": "permit appeal",
      "description": "The Board of Permit Appeals overruled the Department of Public Works' denial of a permit to alter the building at 3032-3034 Jackson Street, with intent to legalize five units, on condition that the fire escape with collapsible ladder be relocated to provide exit to the front of the building, a handrail be provided as required, and the door to the garbage area be provided with a closure device.",
